1
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:17,040
We met Mr. Wang
from their school's study group.

2
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:18,000
We learned that

3
00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:20,040
the premium resources Li Ran got

4
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:21,900
were all backed by the Wei family.

5
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:24,840
I suspect someone instructed

6
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:27,320
Gu Xiaoqiu to report it at this time.

7
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:30,200
It's not impossible.

8
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:32,240
The internet is a mixed bag right now.

9
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:34,360
A lot of information isn't very credible.

10
00:00:34,360 --> 00:00:36,200
But this Wei Feng is too arrogant.

11
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:36,660
He said,

12
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:38,240
"The law is a spider web

13
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:40,360
that can only catch small bugs,

14
00:00:40,360 --> 00:00:41,280
but can't stop

15
00:00:41,280 --> 00:00:42,680
a soaring eagle like me."

16
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:45,370
What kind of eagle is he?

17
00:00:45,480 --> 00:00:47,120
At best, he's just

18
00:00:47,680 --> 00:00:49,810
a little bug leeching off his parents.

19
00:00:50,080 --> 00:00:50,880
Exactly.

20
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:51,480
Asthma medicine.

21
00:00:51,480 --> 00:00:51,800
Chang Kaixin,

22
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:52,000
listen to Chang Kaixin.

23
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:52,560
Asthma medicine,

24
00:00:52,560 --> 00:00:54,160
organize Wei Qishan's files.

25
00:00:54,160 --> 00:00:54,480
Asthma medicine,

26
00:00:54,480 --> 00:00:55,740
we'll follow up later.

27
00:00:57,760 --> 00:00:59,160
Let's focus on our own work first.

28
00:00:59,160 --> 00:01:01,690
Don't let external matters
affect your mood.

29
00:01:02,320 --> 00:01:02,840
Okay.

30
00:01:03,680 --> 00:01:04,360
Wei,

31
00:01:06,280 --> 00:01:07,680
come out with me for a sec.

32
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:21,490
What's going on?

33
00:01:22,680 --> 00:01:25,010
You're a grown man,
why are you so gossipy?

34
00:01:26,600 --> 00:01:28,680
We'll talk about it tonight
when we play games.

35
00:01:28,680 --> 00:01:29,740
You have to tell me.

36
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:37,840
Wei Qishan is a representative entrepreneur
who has been in the industry for years.

37
00:01:37,840 --> 00:01:39,300
He has a lot of connections

38
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:40,600
in business and charity.

39
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:42,840
You want to investigate him
without any proof.

40
00:01:42,840 --> 00:01:43,700
You're scared.

41
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:45,560
It has nothing to do with fear.

42
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:48,090
I just want the investigation
to go smoothly.

43
00:01:48,160 --> 00:01:49,690
I think you're just scared.

44
00:01:50,080 --> 00:01:51,340
Being self-righteous

45
00:01:52,080 --> 00:01:53,479
is your biggest problem.

46
00:01:54,440 --> 00:01:55,970
I just want to solve my case.

47
00:01:56,360 --> 00:01:57,800
I don't care what others think.

48
00:01:57,800 --> 00:01:58,520
Wei,

49
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:01,600
your personality is a double-edged sword.

50
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:09,759
Prosecutor Xu,

51
00:02:09,759 --> 00:02:11,200
Prosecutor Qiao is looking for you.

52
00:02:11,200 --> 00:02:11,640
Got it.

53
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:16,360
Think carefully about what I just said.

54
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:16,690
Also,

55
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:19,000
I'm the head of the investigation team.

56
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:20,200
Don't act on your own.

57
00:02:28,240 --> 00:02:28,800
Prosecutor Fang,

58
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:30,000
I'll head back first.

59
00:02:55,640 --> 00:02:56,440
The deceased

60
00:02:56,440 --> 00:03:00,040
suffered from respiratory distress
caused by allergic asthma.

61
00:03:01,960 --> 00:03:03,960
Li Ran was highly prone to allergies.

62
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:07,360
She had a level-two allergic reaction
to 16 substances,

63
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:09,960
including pollen, cat dander,
and dog dander.

64
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:13,840
She had a level-four allergic reaction
to three substances:

65
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:15,880
cinnamaldehyde, lavender, and rose oil.

66
00:03:15,880 --> 00:03:20,640
Both allergies and the stress of being
assaulted could trigger an acute asthma attack.

67
00:03:20,640 --> 00:03:24,160
Acute allergic asthma attacks
often occur without warning.

68
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:25,960
Within just a few dozen seconds,

69
00:03:25,960 --> 00:03:27,440
a person can become pale

70
00:03:27,640 --> 00:03:28,760
and short of breath.

71
00:03:28,760 --> 00:03:30,360
even losing consciousness.

72
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:35,320
Kaixin,

73
00:03:35,320 --> 00:03:37,720
come with me to see Wei Feng
and the witness.

74
00:03:39,040 --> 00:03:39,480
But

75
00:03:39,480 --> 00:03:42,210
didn't Prosecutor Xu tell us
not to act on our own?

76
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:45,329
Prosecutor Xu also said

77
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:46,660
to do what we need to do.

78
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:50,490
Zhou Yan,

79
00:03:50,880 --> 00:03:51,810
you come with me.

80
00:03:54,200 --> 00:03:54,960
Wei,

81
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:56,160
of course I should go.

82
00:03:56,600 --> 00:03:57,800
I'm the most capable.

83
00:03:58,840 --> 00:03:59,840
Prosecutor Fang,

84
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:01,210
I'm just wondering.

85
00:04:01,600 --> 00:04:03,280
You're not even a team leader.

86
00:04:03,480 --> 00:04:05,160
Why are you taking this so seriously?

87
00:04:05,160 --> 00:04:06,020
How about this?

88
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:07,090
I'll talk

89
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:08,370
to my dad.

90
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:09,780
You resign,

91
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:12,760
and I'll have him arrange
a high-paying job for you.

92
00:04:12,760 --> 00:04:14,320
And you, playing
on the computer over there,

93
00:04:14,320 --> 00:04:15,120
you can get one too.

94
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:15,980
Let me tell you,

95
00:04:16,399 --> 00:04:17,600
no amount of money can buy

96
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:19,360
the uniform I'm wearing.

97
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:20,640
Alright, stop looking.

98
00:04:20,640 --> 00:04:21,959
Stop beating around the bush.

99
00:04:21,959 --> 00:04:23,220
Ask whatever you want.

100
00:04:23,440 --> 00:04:24,500
Then let me ask you.

101
00:04:24,960 --> 00:04:27,320
Did you know that

102
00:04:27,640 --> 00:04:28,160
the surveillance footage
of Li Ran's neighborhood went missing

103
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:28,960
on the day of the incident?

104
00:04:28,960 --> 00:04:31,080
Trying to trick me into saying something?

105
00:04:31,080 --> 00:04:32,010
Your confession

106
00:04:32,400 --> 00:04:32,960
states that you've

107
00:04:32,960 --> 00:04:34,040
heard about this.

108
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:35,600
Do you think it's a coincidence?

109
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:37,080
You already know, don't you?

110
00:04:37,080 --> 00:04:38,440
You're asking what I think?

111
00:04:38,440 --> 00:04:39,080
I think

112
00:04:39,080 --> 00:04:40,480
it's just a coincidence.

113
00:04:40,640 --> 00:04:42,170
Starting from August 2021,

114
00:04:42,760 --> 00:04:44,240
you continuously transferred
money to Li Ran

115
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:45,880
under the guise of project bonuses.

116
00:04:45,880 --> 00:04:47,080
You also funded

117
00:04:47,080 --> 00:04:48,680
Li Ran's mother's hospitalization.

118
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:49,200
But you--

119
00:04:49,200 --> 00:04:50,260
No need for 'buts'.

120
00:04:52,200 --> 00:04:53,440
You must have already investigated

121
00:04:53,440 --> 00:04:55,080
all our financial transactions.

122
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:57,560
Our Weilai Foundation
is strictly for charity.

123
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:59,640
I've already stated this
in my previous confession.

124
00:04:59,640 --> 00:05:00,960
What's the point of asking this again?

125
00:05:00,960 --> 00:05:03,320
If the Weilai Foundation is for charity,

126
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:05,400
why was the transfer to Li Ran

127
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:07,680
specifically labeled as a project bonus?

128
00:05:07,680 --> 00:05:09,200
Because it's my money.

129
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:11,360
I can transfer it however I want.

130
00:05:11,840 --> 00:05:12,240
How does this

131
00:05:12,240 --> 00:05:13,640
have anything to do with Li Ran's death?

132
00:05:13,640 --> 00:05:14,170
Wei Feng,

133
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:15,360
you nailed it.

134
00:05:16,040 --> 00:05:17,040
It actually does.

135
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:24,240
Wei,

136
00:05:24,520 --> 00:05:26,120
I have something to tell you.

137
00:05:27,840 --> 00:05:29,440
Can you not be mad at Zhou Yan?

138
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:31,370
Why would I be mad at him?

139
00:05:31,880 --> 00:05:32,880
Hasn't he been working

140
00:05:32,880 --> 00:05:34,760
with Prosecutor Xu a lot lately?

141
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:37,760
And you and Prosecutor Xu haven't been
seeing eye to eye recently.

142
00:05:37,760 --> 00:05:40,360
It's not easy for him
to be caught in the middle.

143
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:42,280
What are you even talking about?

144
00:05:42,280 --> 00:05:44,440
What goes on in that head
of yours all day?

145
00:05:44,440 --> 00:05:45,640
Did I misunderstand?

146
00:05:46,960 --> 00:05:47,440
No,

147
00:05:47,840 --> 00:05:48,800
do you guys think

148
00:05:49,320 --> 00:05:51,440
Prosecutor Xu and I are fighting?

149
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:55,560
We've known each other for over a decade.

150
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:58,600
She's the reason I chose
to become a prosecutor.

151
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:01,040
I trust her as much as I trust myself.

152
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:04,240
But the situation is different now.

153
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:07,280
Prosecutor Xu has been stuck
at her current rank for a while.

154
00:06:07,280 --> 00:06:08,600
If she handles this case well,

155
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:10,460
she might get promoted this year.

156
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:12,160
What nonsense.

157
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:14,280
I don't care what others think.

158
00:06:14,280 --> 00:06:16,080
You are my assistant, Chang Kaixin.

159
00:06:16,080 --> 00:06:17,200
Don't just blindly follow the crowd.

160
00:06:17,200 --> 00:06:18,680
Just echoing what others say.

161
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:20,720
Wei, I didn't say anything.

162
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:24,800
Ms. Xue,

163
00:06:24,800 --> 00:06:28,260
are you getting used to the room
Chairman Wei arranged for you?

164
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:29,560
Come,

165
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:30,680
ma'am.

166
00:06:31,200 --> 00:06:31,600
Ma'am.

167
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:34,800
Please.

168
00:06:41,760 --> 00:06:42,000
Here, ma'am.

169
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:42,930
Let me take that.

170
00:06:54,280 --> 00:06:54,880
Ma'am,

171
00:06:56,400 --> 00:06:57,720
I'm also responsible

172
00:06:57,720 --> 00:06:59,000
for what happened.

173
00:06:59,080 --> 00:07:00,200
I apologize to you.

174
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:02,130
Apologies are useless.

175
00:07:03,080 --> 00:07:04,680
My daughter is already gone.

176
00:07:06,320 --> 00:07:07,920
I just want to clear her name.

177
00:07:08,960 --> 00:07:10,820
I understand how you feel, ma'am.

178
00:07:11,120 --> 00:07:11,720
After all,

179
00:07:11,960 --> 00:07:13,020
I'm a daughter too.

180
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:14,540
I have a mother too.

181
00:07:25,400 --> 00:07:26,000
Ma'am,

182
00:07:26,840 --> 00:07:28,840
this is compensation from our group.

183
00:07:28,840 --> 00:07:30,080
It's just a small token.

184
00:07:30,080 --> 00:07:31,540
You can fill in any amount.

185
00:07:32,960 --> 00:07:34,159
What do you mean?

186
00:07:34,520 --> 00:07:35,180
She's gone.

187
00:07:35,760 --> 00:07:37,090
What's the use of money?

188
00:07:37,880 --> 00:07:40,540
I know you've been funding
Xiaoran's education

189
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:42,400
and helping our family a lot,

190
00:07:44,880 --> 00:07:46,940
but my child died such a tragic death.

191
00:07:48,080 --> 00:07:48,960
As her mother,

192
00:07:49,880 --> 00:07:51,409
I must seek justice for her.

193
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:56,880
I will make sure her killer rots in hell.

194
00:07:59,040 --> 00:08:00,170
Absolutely, ma'am.

195
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:01,560
But

196
00:08:01,560 --> 00:08:02,440
we have to leave catching the bad guys

197
00:08:02,440 --> 00:08:03,520
to the police.

198
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:05,920
The most important thing for you right now

199
00:08:05,920 --> 00:08:07,450
is to take care of yourself.

200
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:12,720
It breaks my heart

201
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:14,450
to see those rumors online too.

202
00:08:14,960 --> 00:08:15,560
Ma'am,

203
00:08:16,440 --> 00:08:17,840
let's not talk about this anymore.

204
00:08:17,840 --> 00:08:18,970
Let's turn the page.

205
00:08:19,840 --> 00:08:21,440
The most important thing now

206
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:23,930
is to let Xiaoran

207
00:08:24,440 --> 00:08:25,720
rest in peace.

208
00:08:31,960 --> 00:08:32,720
Sister,

209
00:08:33,640 --> 00:08:34,799
My sincerity

210
00:08:34,799 --> 00:08:35,960
is always here.

211
00:08:37,760 --> 00:08:39,419
No need to rush your decision.

212
00:08:39,919 --> 00:08:41,039
Think it over.

213
00:08:42,240 --> 00:08:42,880
Wei,

214
00:08:43,360 --> 00:08:45,360
are we sure we're meeting
the witness here?

215
00:08:45,360 --> 00:08:46,520
Do you even need to ask?

216
00:08:46,520 --> 00:08:47,520
They picked the place.

217
00:08:47,520 --> 00:08:48,920
Do you have a better idea?

218
00:08:49,640 --> 00:08:50,480
Alright.

219
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:56,060
Come on,

220
00:08:56,640 --> 00:08:57,400
bottoms up.

221
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:14,440
Excuse me, everyone.

222
00:09:14,840 --> 00:09:17,920
I'm Fang Wei, a prosecutor from the First Division
of Beitan Municipal People's Procuratorate.

223
00:09:17,920 --> 00:09:19,520
This is my assistant, Chang Kaixin.

224
00:09:19,520 --> 00:09:21,680
Which of you are Fu Shaoqing
and Liang Dong?

225
00:09:21,680 --> 00:09:22,610
Please step out.

226
00:09:24,040 --> 00:09:25,370
The prosecutor is here.

227
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:28,440
Didn't expect you to actually come.

228
00:09:30,640 --> 00:09:31,720
Quite pretty, too.

229
00:09:33,120 --> 00:09:34,650
You are Fu Shaoqing, right?

230
00:09:35,400 --> 00:09:37,080
You're a key witness in the Wei Feng case.

231
00:09:37,080 --> 00:09:37,940
Please step out

232
00:09:38,040 --> 00:09:39,120
and cooperate with our inquiry.

233
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:40,160
What is it

234
00:09:40,600 --> 00:09:42,600
that we can't talk about right here?

235
00:09:42,880 --> 00:09:44,010
Why do it in private?

236
00:09:44,280 --> 00:09:46,040
I'm so scared.

237
00:09:46,400 --> 00:09:47,400
Go on, Fu.

238
00:09:47,520 --> 00:09:48,520
The prosecutor is calling you.

239
00:09:48,520 --> 00:09:49,880
Yeah, go on.

240
00:09:49,880 --> 00:09:50,680
Go ahead.

241
00:09:50,880 --> 00:09:52,360
Stop being so sarcastic.

242
00:09:52,640 --> 00:09:53,880
We are conducting a routine visit.

243
00:09:53,880 --> 00:09:54,680
It's our job.

244
00:09:56,000 --> 00:09:57,060
This chick is cute.

245
00:09:57,440 --> 00:09:58,040
I like her.

246
00:09:59,320 --> 00:10:00,050
A visit, huh?

247
00:10:00,680 --> 00:10:01,940
See that row of drinks?

248
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:03,800
Drink them, and I'll cooperate.

249
00:10:03,800 --> 00:10:04,880
By law,

250
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:07,400
you are obligated to cooperate
with our inquiry.

251
00:10:07,400 --> 00:10:08,880
Please don't make this difficult for us.

252
00:10:08,880 --> 00:10:09,540
Otherwise,

253
00:10:09,920 --> 00:10:11,160
things will get ugly for you too.

254
00:10:11,160 --> 00:10:12,880
Get this straight, okay?

255
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:15,520
You're the ones asking for my cooperation.

256
00:10:15,520 --> 00:10:16,650
With that attitude,

257
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:18,850
how am I supposed to cooperate?

258
00:10:19,280 --> 00:10:21,040
The body camera is on.

259
00:10:21,360 --> 00:10:23,000
Are you sure you want

260
00:10:23,560 --> 00:10:25,120
to provoke public servants on camera?

261
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:26,520
Are you trying to scare me?

262
00:10:26,520 --> 00:10:26,980
Come on.

263
00:10:27,360 --> 00:10:27,840
Try me.

264
00:10:29,560 --> 00:10:30,290
Fu Shaoqing.

265
00:10:40,760 --> 00:10:41,820
I'm sorry, you two.

266
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:44,120
My friend here doesn't know
when to shut up.

267
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:44,800
He offended you.

268
00:10:44,800 --> 00:10:45,460
I apologize

269
00:10:46,080 --> 00:10:47,480
to you both on his behalf.

270
00:10:47,840 --> 00:10:49,000
You're Liang Dong, right?

271
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:49,320
I am.

272
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:52,240
You were also with Wei Feng
on the night of March 7th.

273
00:10:52,240 --> 00:10:53,800
You'll need to answer
some questions later.

274
00:10:53,800 --> 00:10:54,460
No problem.

275
00:10:54,880 --> 00:10:56,280
It's my duty as a citizen.

276
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:57,760
But I can't do it today.

277
00:10:57,760 --> 00:10:58,820
Can we reschedule?

278
00:10:59,160 --> 00:11:01,200
I don't really have time today either.

279
00:11:01,200 --> 00:11:02,730
I'm going abroad tomorrow.

280
00:11:02,880 --> 00:11:03,410
How about

281
00:11:03,800 --> 00:11:04,840
we talk when I get back?

282
00:11:04,840 --> 00:11:06,000
What's wrong with you?

283
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:07,240
Why call us here if you won't cooperate?

284
00:11:07,240 --> 00:11:08,560
I was just joking.

285
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:11,050
Who knew they'd actually come?

286
00:11:13,640 --> 00:11:15,480
You've got some nerve now, haven't you?

287
00:11:15,480 --> 00:11:16,210
Fu Shaoqing,

288
00:11:17,560 --> 00:11:19,760
you dare joke around with prosecutors?

289
00:11:22,560 --> 00:11:24,490
I suggest you don't push it too far.

290
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:25,480
Don't end up like Wei Feng,

291
00:11:25,480 --> 00:11:26,360
with no way out.

292
00:11:26,640 --> 00:11:29,160
You'll be crying for your dad to save you.

293
00:11:30,840 --> 00:11:31,770
I'm sorry, Dong.

294
00:11:33,480 --> 00:11:34,740
Please don't mind him.

295
00:11:36,200 --> 00:11:36,960
He's just a lowlife,

296
00:11:36,960 --> 00:11:38,090
not worth your time.

297
00:11:40,080 --> 00:11:41,140
My time is limited.

298
00:11:41,280 --> 00:11:43,240
I don't have time to play games with you.

299
00:11:43,240 --> 00:11:44,800
Since you refuse to cooperate,

300
00:11:44,800 --> 00:11:46,800
we'll see you at the procuratorate.

301
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:56,800
Every single one of them is up to no good.

302
00:11:56,800 --> 00:11:58,200
And they even provoked us.

303
00:11:58,200 --> 00:11:59,560
It's so infuriating.

304
00:11:59,960 --> 00:12:00,690
It's normal.

305
00:12:00,760 --> 00:12:02,360
You'll run into this again,

306
00:12:02,560 --> 00:12:03,760
maybe even worse.

307
00:12:03,880 --> 00:12:04,940
Just get used to it.

308
00:12:05,440 --> 00:12:06,840
So protect yourself.

309
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:08,690
Don't be afraid of them.

310
00:12:09,560 --> 00:12:10,880
I'll learn from you then.

311
00:12:10,880 --> 00:12:12,010
Stop flattering me.

312
00:12:14,080 --> 00:12:16,200
So what do we do now?

313
00:12:16,840 --> 00:12:19,360
The surveillance
at Tianlang Mountain Resort is missing.

314
00:12:19,360 --> 00:12:21,520
Fu Shaoqing and Liang Dong
are key witnesses.

315
00:12:21,520 --> 00:12:23,280
Their testimonies are crucial.

316
00:12:23,280 --> 00:12:25,000
Let's head back to the office first.

317
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:26,680
Then we'll fight them to the end.

318
00:12:26,680 --> 00:12:27,080
Wei,

319
00:12:27,240 --> 00:12:28,600
I'll always have your back.

320
00:12:28,600 --> 00:12:29,130
Let's go.

321
00:12:50,280 --> 00:12:52,560
I really appreciate how dedicated

322
00:12:52,560 --> 00:12:54,080
you two prosecutors are.

323
00:12:54,560 --> 00:12:56,920
Did you come down here
just to tell me this?

324
00:12:57,320 --> 00:12:58,120
Of course not.

325
00:12:58,680 --> 00:13:00,200
Do you know why those guys upstairs

326
00:13:00,200 --> 00:13:01,720
didn't cooperate with you?

327
00:13:01,720 --> 00:13:03,650
We all share a slice of the same pie.

328
00:13:04,560 --> 00:13:05,620
Who would publicly

329
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:07,290
betray their partners,

330
00:13:07,480 --> 00:13:07,880
right?

331
00:13:11,800 --> 00:13:13,460
Actually, I just wanted to say

332
00:13:13,880 --> 00:13:15,720
you only need me for this.

333
00:13:16,720 --> 00:13:18,120
I know Wei Feng very well.

334
00:13:18,560 --> 00:13:19,360
Interesting.

335
00:13:19,520 --> 00:13:20,080
Go on.

336
00:13:20,520 --> 00:13:21,920
I can give you some leads.

337
00:13:23,320 --> 00:13:25,200
But what if you get scared

338
00:13:25,200 --> 00:13:26,320
and drop the case

339
00:13:27,560 --> 00:13:28,120
halfway?

340
00:13:29,080 --> 00:13:29,880
Rest assured.

341
00:13:30,360 --> 00:13:32,440
No matter who's backing Wei Feng,

342
00:13:32,880 --> 00:13:34,480
we'll get to the bottom of it.

343
00:13:39,200 --> 00:13:40,040
Then you won't

344
00:13:41,040 --> 00:13:42,240
sell me out, will you?

345
00:13:42,800 --> 00:13:44,800
Citizens are obligated to cooperate
with our investigation.

346
00:13:44,800 --> 00:13:46,000
And we also have a duty

347
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:47,800
to protect a witness's privacy.

348
00:13:49,280 --> 00:13:50,560
In August 2021,

349
00:13:51,360 --> 00:13:53,090
Li Ran's mother was hit by a car.

350
00:13:54,320 --> 00:13:55,880
Just follow this lead.

351
00:13:56,200 --> 00:13:58,400
Come back to me when you find something.

352
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:01,120
Good luck.

353
00:14:09,040 --> 00:14:09,440
Hello.

354
00:14:10,520 --> 00:14:11,120
You must be

355
00:14:11,320 --> 00:14:12,580
Chengcheng's mother.

356
00:14:13,720 --> 00:14:15,880
I'm the father of
Chengcheng's good friend, Lele.

357
00:14:15,880 --> 00:14:16,880
My surname is Qin.

358
00:14:17,800 --> 00:14:18,460
Lawyer Qin.

359
00:14:18,760 --> 00:14:19,080
Yes.

360
00:14:19,880 --> 00:14:22,140
The defense lawyer for the Wei Feng case.

361
00:14:22,520 --> 00:14:24,580
I'm the person in charge of this case.

362
00:14:24,680 --> 00:14:25,320
It seems

363
00:14:25,760 --> 00:14:28,220
a bit inappropriate for us
to meet like this.

364
00:14:29,560 --> 00:14:30,080
Don't mind it,

365
00:14:30,080 --> 00:14:30,480
Ms. Xu.

366
00:14:31,160 --> 00:14:32,560
It's just a coincidence.

367
00:14:32,920 --> 00:14:33,680
Besides,

368
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:36,080
there are no lawyers or prosecutors here.

369
00:14:36,080 --> 00:14:37,480
Just parents of the kids.

370
00:14:37,680 --> 00:14:38,360
Then please

371
00:14:39,120 --> 00:14:40,520
help me call Chengcheng out.

372
00:14:40,520 --> 00:14:41,520
We should go home.

373
00:14:44,440 --> 00:14:45,600
The kids are having a great time

374
00:14:45,600 --> 00:14:46,860
at the birthday party.

375
00:14:47,120 --> 00:14:48,580
Let them play a bit longer.

376
00:14:48,720 --> 00:14:50,180
Let's not be spoilsports.

377
00:14:54,920 --> 00:14:55,600
Your car

378
00:14:56,440 --> 00:14:57,240
is quite old.

379
00:14:57,880 --> 00:14:58,280
What,

380
00:14:58,840 --> 00:15:00,370
a lawyer also studies cars?

381
00:15:01,440 --> 00:15:02,240
I just dabble.

382
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:04,560
I didn't know much at first either.

383
00:15:04,560 --> 00:15:06,680
But my son keeps nagging me every day.

384
00:15:07,440 --> 00:15:09,970
Saying who in his class
or family got a new car.

385
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:12,080
Kids nowadays have seen the world.

386
00:15:12,400 --> 00:15:13,640
As parents,

387
00:15:14,320 --> 00:15:16,400
we can't let our kids lose face

388
00:15:16,760 --> 00:15:18,160
because of us in these aspects.

389
00:15:18,160 --> 00:15:20,240
Our Chengcheng rarely talks about this.

390
00:15:20,240 --> 00:15:20,760
Really?

391
00:15:22,440 --> 00:15:23,200
But

392
00:15:23,760 --> 00:15:24,840
my son said

393
00:15:25,400 --> 00:15:27,330
Chengcheng envies him quite a bit.

394
00:15:28,960 --> 00:15:29,960
Understandable.

395
00:15:30,200 --> 00:15:32,330
Ms. Xu, you might be too busy with work,

396
00:15:32,560 --> 00:15:34,820
and paying less attention to your child.

397
00:15:36,920 --> 00:15:37,440
Just

398
00:15:37,880 --> 00:15:38,410
kidding.

399
00:15:42,160 --> 00:15:43,360
Time flies so fast.

400
00:15:43,960 --> 00:15:45,120
These kids will be

401
00:15:45,680 --> 00:15:47,080
in high school next year.

402
00:15:48,880 --> 00:15:50,360
Which school is Chengcheng

403
00:15:50,360 --> 00:15:51,360
planning to go to?

404
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:53,450
We don't have a plan yet.

405
00:15:53,880 --> 00:15:55,080
You need to plan early

406
00:15:55,240 --> 00:15:56,970
for something this important.

407
00:15:57,960 --> 00:15:59,480
Ms. Xu, here's what I'm thinking.

408
00:15:59,480 --> 00:16:01,340
Chengcheng and Lele are so close,

409
00:16:02,640 --> 00:16:04,170
so let's not separate them.

410
00:16:04,200 --> 00:16:05,600
I happen to have a relative

411
00:16:05,600 --> 00:16:06,480
who's the principal

412
00:16:06,480 --> 00:16:07,740
at No. 4 Middle School.

413
00:16:08,080 --> 00:16:10,010
Let's just have both kids go there.

414
00:16:10,280 --> 00:16:11,340
No. 4 Middle School

415
00:16:13,040 --> 00:16:13,970
is a good school.

416
00:16:15,480 --> 00:16:17,080
I respect my child's wishes.

417
00:16:17,240 --> 00:16:18,440
I'll talk to the kids.

418
00:16:19,120 --> 00:16:20,580
If you treat me as a friend,

419
00:16:20,720 --> 00:16:21,240
I'll take care of this

420
00:16:21,240 --> 00:16:22,200
for you.

421
00:16:22,800 --> 00:16:24,040
Are you trying

422
00:16:24,040 --> 00:16:25,500
to make me break the rules?

423
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:28,640
You're overstating it, Ms. Xu.

424
00:16:28,640 --> 00:16:31,440
We're just parents discussing our kids.

425
00:16:31,880 --> 00:16:33,410
It's not against the rules.

426
00:16:33,920 --> 00:16:34,560
Mom!

427
00:16:36,080 --> 00:16:36,560
Cheng.

428
00:16:37,240 --> 00:16:38,040
Study hard.

429
00:16:38,240 --> 00:16:40,320
Let's go to No. 4 High School together.

430
00:16:40,320 --> 00:16:41,580
What No. 4 High School?

431
00:16:42,760 --> 00:16:43,690
Did you have fun?

432
00:16:43,720 --> 00:16:44,650
I had a lot of fun.

433
00:16:44,720 --> 00:16:45,520
Let's go home.

434
00:17:02,840 --> 00:17:03,720
Chairman Wei,

435
00:17:03,880 --> 00:17:05,079
you're quite shrewd.

436
00:17:05,520 --> 00:17:07,119
Tripping up over your own son

437
00:17:07,880 --> 00:17:09,480
is truly unbelievable to me.

438
00:17:10,880 --> 00:17:12,839
He's only this willful

439
00:17:13,640 --> 00:17:16,770
because you've been looking out
for him all these years.

440
00:17:22,880 --> 00:17:24,079
I've always heard

441
00:17:24,800 --> 00:17:26,730
you're a fan of Zhao Mengfu's work.

442
00:17:27,079 --> 00:17:28,160
Could you appraise

443
00:17:28,880 --> 00:17:30,210
these two pieces for me?

444
00:17:30,240 --> 00:17:30,760
Wei,

445
00:17:31,040 --> 00:17:33,240
you're trying to make me cross the line.

446
00:17:33,760 --> 00:17:35,000
It's just a fake.

447
00:17:35,320 --> 00:17:36,320
If you don't mind,

448
00:17:36,440 --> 00:17:37,440
please accept it.

449
00:17:37,800 --> 00:17:38,600
We can't just

450
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:40,650
abandon traditional culture.

451
00:18:02,960 --> 00:18:04,160
You haven't left yet?

452
00:18:05,200 --> 00:18:06,280
Where's Chengcheng?

453
00:18:06,280 --> 00:18:07,140
I sent him home.

454
00:18:07,400 --> 00:18:09,200
I still have some work to finish.

455
00:18:09,760 --> 00:18:10,620
What about you?

456
00:18:10,720 --> 00:18:11,920
Why haven't you left?

457
00:18:12,480 --> 00:18:14,410
I went to look up some information.

458
00:18:25,720 --> 00:18:26,440
How's the work going

459
00:18:26,440 --> 00:18:27,570
these past few days?

460
00:18:27,840 --> 00:18:28,640
Not very fast.

461
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:29,980
Unexpected things

462
00:18:30,240 --> 00:18:32,440
keep interrupting the investigation.

463
00:18:32,480 --> 00:18:33,340
That's normal.

464
00:18:33,600 --> 00:18:35,400
Investigation is a game of wits.

465
00:18:35,800 --> 00:18:36,200
I know.

466
00:18:36,960 --> 00:18:37,560
How's your

467
00:18:37,680 --> 00:18:39,810
investigation into Wei Qishan going?

468
00:18:40,280 --> 00:18:41,610
Everything is on track.

469
00:18:42,840 --> 00:18:43,600
Wei,

470
00:18:44,280 --> 00:18:46,160
whether it's work or life,

471
00:18:46,520 --> 00:18:47,880
just go at your own pace.

472
00:18:48,480 --> 00:18:50,810
Don't let any outside factors affect you.

473
00:18:51,680 --> 00:18:52,540
Including you?

474
00:18:53,080 --> 00:18:53,880
Including me.

475
00:19:00,600 --> 00:19:01,120
Director Xu,

476
00:19:01,120 --> 00:19:01,680
here's

477
00:19:01,800 --> 00:19:02,520
a report letter.

478
00:19:02,520 --> 00:19:04,180
It says it's for Department 1.

479
00:19:05,840 --> 00:19:06,680
Is the person still here?

480
00:19:06,680 --> 00:19:08,080
I didn't even see anyone.

481
00:19:09,320 --> 00:19:09,650
Okay.

482
00:19:09,840 --> 00:19:10,960
Mr. Li, you can get back to work then.
